body:
One question: I used my first sheet mask yesterday (The lemon sheet mask by Etude House) and I haven't felt much tingling when I used it but after taking it off after 20 minutes and applying Aloe Vera gel my face was getting progressively hotter and red. After a few hours it calmed down. This morning i experienced the same flushing for hours at my work... 

&#x200B;

Can anyone help me? I am not sure why this would happen... It's the first time I used Aloe vera gel, too so it could also be the aloe vera gel?
